  "name": "Submit and look up DocupletionForms forms with an AI agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Submit and look up DocupletionForms forms with an AI agent\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow starts from an incoming chat message and sends the user’s request to an AI Agent. The agent uses an OpenAI chat model to decide whether to submit a DocupletionForms form or look up existing submissions, then invokes the appropriate DocupletionForms tool.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the chat trigger so users can send messages to the workflow.\n- Add valid OpenAI credentials for the OpenAI Chat Model node and select the desired model.\n- Add DocupletionForms credentials to both DocupletionForms tool nodes.\n- Configure the target form IDs and any required field mappings or tool descriptions so the AI agent can call the tools correctly.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the AI Agent instructions, OpenAI model, and DocupletionForms tool settings to control which forms are available and how users should phrase submission or lookup requests.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 768
      },
